'''Blue Swirly Axe ''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the player who finished '''Top 100''' in the [[Christmas Event 2021]] '''Coin-Collecting''' Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Blue Swirly Axe has the same appearance as [[Swirly Axe]], but replacing the red color with a dark blue coloring.

== Trivia ==
*Other variants of this include [[Gold Swirly Axe]], [[Silver Swirly Axe]], and [[Bronze Swirly Axe]].
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*On June 30, 2022, a day before players received this trophy, [[Nikilis]] wiped many exploiters off the leaderboard. This means that a few lucky players that finished just below the top 100 on the leaderboard got bumped up and received this trophy.

